  "notes": "{憧|あこが}れる expresses deep admiration, longing, or aspiration toward something one finds ideal or desirable.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pattern: 〜に{憧|あこが}れる (to admire/long for ~)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {都会|とかい}に{憧|あこが}れる: to long for city life\n- {有名人|ゆうめいじん}に{憧|あこが}れる: to admire a celebrity\n- {憧|あこが}れの{存在|そんざい}: someone one admires\n- {憧|あこが}れの{職業|しょくぎょう}: a dream job\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{憧|あこが}れている means \"admires\" or \"has been longing for\" — an ongoing state of admiration.\n\nNOUN FORM:\n{憧|あこが}れ (admiration, longing) is commonly used: {子|こ}どもの{頃|ころ}からの{憧|あこが}れ (a longing since childhood).",
